  "notes": "{床屋|とこや} traditionally refers to men's barbershops.\n\nBARBERSHOP vs HAIR SALON:\n- {床屋|とこや}/⟦{理髪店|りはつてん}→理髪店：06320_rihatsuten⟧: barbershop (traditionally for men)\n- ⟦{美容院|びよういん}→美容院：06319_biyouin⟧/⟦{美容室|びようしつ}→美容室：20238_biyoushitsu⟧: hair salon (originally for women, now unisex)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {床屋|とこや}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧: to go to the barber\n- {床屋|とこや}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧: to get a haircut at the barber\n\nNote: Younger generations often use ⟦{美容院|びよういん}→美容院：06319_biyouin⟧ regardless of gender. {床屋|とこや} can sound slightly old-fashioned.",
